e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fzR3YHw4ukoQ7kNvwEqukIX&_nc_oc=AdrJ5JZgVUu0u6P7agN-U4JWAcO5PuMttXbOVVmKV4AuFuLByhNuvLmvUUGVlSBttQ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCxrAeH_MppaVWhS7L6ThtLnyBwI8SgM6y_AaiYxSmQvw&oe=6A4FB979"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zxl2HFpLatQQ7kNvwEJxEFy&_nc_oc=AdqM13KhU5MZjf69RDE8jeYworlIYIGGrSNhxk1NP2zlBXMLNo8jdy4BNx2BCeLBlr8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBKlhI6-nA5rRJvCEDlLWyBmbS7NyBprk3DbkmGFr4Ngw&oe=6A4F90D3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fhxislWwvKEQ7kNvwF8bb8R&_nc_oc=AdrY1mrHhsIElICnZgj1m9YLwWEBW5YTxrfJyTzzYjpxaAoog8xzKSMIgYG_Fm4avls&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCRiA0lG2G5St0sZuS2R8GGzNb2mLLFomdv7vNmQPTEUQ&oe=6A4F9C7B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_k1HdepTFtkQ7kNvwE1j50H&_nc_oc=Adru66-usTllUwmuHkQI6kRan5K5kj5aowyV9zTpVDSJuQbR1ee50qVFh8vDc3xXYUA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDj9nHJjFXnEY3VcfGlsGs8DGMCixFmhcx01iS_pBbtqw&oe=6A4F9DCA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mAxViD5uGCkQ7kNvwE_uss5&_nc_oc=AdrUUkjfhxWHr_qKU4cFTNp9BPbO71KjZTUAh-tJ-Tzfb9ZOq5ac3SORM0TSg35TDMI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDsRhpSKfWycjUoyqRSBiCscXmr_hVHSf3Cg46KdBWacQ&oe=6A4FBF3E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se